{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_11211770","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11211770","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1121177001:0":{"text":"Most honored Talene, the task is in your hands now. Please use your divine fire to restore the Deer Spirit statue to its former glory.","source_cn":"塔琳殿下，接下来就拜托你了，请你用神圣的火焰，让鹿灵雕...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A3C74B81370FB47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1121177002:1":{"text":"Wait a moment... the Hypogean will eventually just turn to his next target. We need to lure him out.","source_cn":"稍等，那个恶魔迟早会转向下一个目标，得引他出来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF861F0A03C6035AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1121177003:1":{"text":"He's accustomed to hiding in spaces created by magic, elusive and unpredictable, but not entirely without weakness because...","source_cn":"他习惯躲藏在法术所造的空间里，神出鬼没，但并不是毫无方法。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93B81C173A3D2869","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1121177004:1":{"text":"... he's obsessed with symmetry.","source_cn":"——因为他追求极致的对称。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13D731BF730CA031","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1121177004":{"text":"... he's obsessed with symmetry.","source_cn":"——因为他追求极致的对称。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13D731BF730CA031","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1121177005:1":{"text":"If we purposefully introduce asymmetry and disorder, the Hypogean will appear?","source_cn":"既如此，只要刻意做出不对称之物，就能诱使恶魔现身？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04FD751BD07D747C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1121177006:1":{"text":"He'll spare no effort to correct \"mistakes\" he deems displeasing to the eye.","source_cn":"嗯，他会不惜一切代价来纠正错误。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F1EF0E241C8EB6C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1121177007:1":{"text":"Ah! We could arrange leaves and branches in a specific, beautiful pattern before introducing <style=\"highlight\">irregular fruit</style> to muddle up the aesthetics...","source_cn":"因地制宜的话，比如先对称摆好形态相近的树枝或花朵，但最...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3EAC3D72FD4287D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1121177008:1":{"text":"Would something like that work, Talene?","source_cn":"这样就可以了吗，塔琳殿下？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3FEC370DDA521DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_titl